     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table12_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">5 à 100</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table12_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Opacity</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table12_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">adjust</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table12_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">[famille] rôle h l c ; [famille] <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">reset</text:span> ; <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">reset all</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table12_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">la ligne de retouche</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table12_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">defaults</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table12_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">(sans valeur) les valeurs d’usine, style Classic compris</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table12_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Factory defaults</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table12_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">default</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table12_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">les clés qui suivent définissent le défaut de l’utilisateur, sans l’appliquer (sauf <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">theme</text:span> et <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">size</text:span>)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table12_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Save as default</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table12_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">restore</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table12_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">(sans valeur) applique le défaut de l’utilisateur</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table12_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Reset to default</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Dans <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">adjust</text:span>, la famille est celle du moment si elle n’est pas donnée ; les rôles s’écrivent comme dans l’aperçu (Action, Choice, Navigation, Value, Object, State, Danger, Alert, Information, Empty). Tout ce qui suit <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">default</text:span> va au défaut : on écrit donc <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">restore</text:span> et les réglages courants avant lui. Les erreurs de ces réglages sont les codes 1640 (une clé attendue), 1641 (une valeur hors de sa plage) et 1642 (une valeur qui n’est pas l’une de celles de la clé) ; la première erreur arrête la lecture, les réglages pris avant elle restent.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1"><text:bookmark-start text:name="fichiers-préréglages-et-exports"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1149_2852353392"/>Fichiers, préréglages et exports<text:bookmark-end text:name="fichiers-préréglages-et-exports"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1149_2852353392"/></text:h>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="le-glisser-déposer"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1151_2852353392"/>Le glisser-déposer<text:bookmark-end text:name="le-glisser-déposer"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1151_2852353392"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">On peut faire glisser des fichiers depuis le Finder (ou l’Explorateur) dans la fenêtre d’un plug-in :</text:p>
   <table:table table:name="Table10_1_1" table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.B"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.C"/>
    <table:table-header-rows>
     <table:table-row>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Fichier</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Plug-in</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Effet</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
     </table:table-row>
    </table:table-header-rows>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">script <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">.mSL</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">tous</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">le script est compilé et exécuté ; ses messages vont dans le journal ; on peut en déposer plusieurs à la fois</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">script <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">.mSL</text:span> sur le module <text:span text:style-name="T2">mSL Console</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">tous</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">le script est compilé et exécuté, et devient le contexte de la console : les lignes tapées ensuite partagent ses variables (§ 8.6)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">script <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">.mSL</text:span> sur la case <text:span text:style-name="T2">Profile</text:span> du module <text:span text:style-name="T2">Scripts Settings</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Game Master</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">le script devient le Profile du projet</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">fichier <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">.RPP</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Game Master</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">le Game Master apprend où se trouve le projet (à faire après tout déplacement du projet)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">Clips.txt</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Game Master</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">la liste des clips du dossier <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">WAVES</text:span> (voir le manuel du Game Master)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">sons (<text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">.wav</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">.aif</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">.flac</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">.mp3</text:span>…)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Game Master, Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P19">associés à des numéros de clips (module <text:span text:style-name="T2">Clips Selection</text:span>) ou chargés dans une ligne <text:span text:style-name="T17">(</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18">buffer</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T17">) </text:span>d’Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">configurations et trajectoires de <text:span text:style-name="T2">GRM Spaces</text:span> (<text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">.ala</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">.lay</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">.xml</text:span>)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Espaces</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table10_5f_1_5f_1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">pour la vue 3D et les modules <text:span text:style-name="T2">Edit</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Chaque plug-in précise dans son manuel où déposer ses fichiers, quand l’endroit compte.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="préréglages-et-sauvegarde"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1153_2852353392"/>Préréglages et sauvegarde<text:bookmark-end text:name="préréglages-et-sauvegarde"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1153_2852353392"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">L’état complet d’un plug-in — onglets, panneaux, modules, réglages, thème, taille d’affichage, et les données propres au plug-in — est enregistré par REAPER <text:span text:style-name="T1">avec le projet</text:span>, dans le fichier <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">.RPP</text:span>. On retrouve donc tout à la réouverture du projet.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">Le même état peut être enregistré comme <text:span text:style-name="T1">préréglage</text:span> (bouton « <text:span text:style-name="T1">+ »</text:span> de la barre de REAPER, <text:span text:style-name="T2">Save preset…</text:span>), pour être rechargé dans un autre projet. REAPER range les préréglages dans le dossier <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">presets</text:span> de ses ressources, dans un fichier par plug-in (<text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">js-CMGS-effects_&lt;plug-in&gt;_jsfx.ini</text:span>). Le choix <text:span text:style-name="T2">Reset to factory default</text:span> du même menu rend au plug-in son état initial.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">L’état de certains plug-ins, du Game Master en particulier, est volumineux : c’est pourquoi on conseille de régler à 0 la mémoire d’annulation <text:span text:style-name="T17">(</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18">Undo</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T17">) </text:span>de REAPER (voir l’installation).</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P20"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="les-exports"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1155_2852353392"/>Les exports<text:bookmark-end text:name="les-exports"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1155_2852353392"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr2" draw:name="Image9" text:anchor-type="paragraph" svg:x="3.016cm" svg:y="0.028cm" svg:width="9.89cm" svg:height="4.08cm" draw:z-index="12"><draw:image draw:mime-type="image/png">
